8vt
0vt
1vt
2vt
3vt
4vt
5vt
6vt
7vt

/etc/ttytype for V6: one line per terminal, the last character
of its name in /dev (8 for /dev/tty8, the console, 0 to 7 for the
lines of a DC11, as with "set dci lines=8" in SIMH) followed by
the two character type code from /etc/ttycap.  The blank line
above ends the list.  "ttytype -n" lists the codes.
